{"resourceIdentifier":"2591","resourceName":"Yongkang huachuan MSW landfill site LFG comprehensive utilization project","description":"Yongkang huachuan MSW landfill site LFG comprehensive utilization project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located at Huachuan village MSW landfill site (hereafter referred to as the Huachuan landfill site), in Yongkang City, Zhejiang Province, P.R. China. The project is constructed and operated by Yongkang Baichang New Energy CO., Ltd. (hereafter referred to as the project owner).\r\nThe project started to construct on 13/06/2020.The project has a total designed capacity 1MW (2*0.5MW) and combusts the LFG, which contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the Eastern China Power Grid (ECPG). Total electricity supplied to the grid in the crediting period will be 79,933MWh. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the grid electricity displaced. The estimated average GHG emission reductions of the project is 48,363tCO2e and the total GHG emission reductions and removals are 483,633tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period.","location":{"latitude":28.901384,"longitude":119.941665},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-10-15","endExclusive":"2021-11-15","endInclusive":"2021-11-14"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2591"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Zhejiang Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2591"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value